  "name": "PACE-ASD",
  "description": "Research software for cross-validated modeling of whole-body movement in short videos: MediaPipe landmark extraction in pixel units, shared sequence preparation (plausibility check, onset alignment), a contiguous-event network with frame-validity masking, five comparison architectures, gait-descriptor classifiers, repeated nested subject-level cross-validation with stored out-of-fold predictions, recording-artifact controls, a planted-event benchmark, and inference with checkpoint ensembles. Not a medical device.",
